HARK! "The Mikado's Little List"
  or, "In Which Numbers are Subjected to Divisibility and Found Wanting"

(ASIDE, AT SOME LENGTH:
  The Lord High Executioner Ko-Ko has compiled his celebrated list.
  Numbers divisible by three are marked as "Fizz" (a trifling offence).
  Numbers divisible by five are marked as "Buzz" (a more serious matter).
  Numbers divisible by both are marked as "FizzBuzz" (the gravest category).
  All others are proclaimed in their natural state, which is punishment enough.

  "As someday it may happen that a victim must be found,
   I've got a little list — I've got a little list."
END OF ASIDE.)

PRINCIPALS
  PRAY WELCOME idx        AS A PEER    BEING 1
  PRAY WELCOME limit      AS A PEER    BEING 100
  PRAY WELCOME by_three   AS A DECREE
  PRAY WELCOME by_five    AS A DECREE
  PRAY WELCOME output     AS A YARN
THE CURTAIN RISES.

BEHOLD "THE MIKADO'S LITTLE LIST"
BEHOLD "Numbers 1 to 100, sorted and condemned as appropriate."
BEHOLD "----------------------------------------------------------"

BY A LEGAL FICTION KNOWN AS the_list WHILST UNLIKE idx AND LARGER OF idx AND limit

  ASIDE: determine divisibility — the matter is of the gravest importance
  by_three IS APPOINTED ALIKE REMAINDER OF idx AND 3 AND 0
  by_five IS APPOINTED ALIKE REMAINDER OF idx AND 5 AND 0

  ASIDE: render judgement with appropriate ceremony
  SHOULD IT TRANSPIRE THAT BOTH by_three AND by_five
    QUITE SO.
      output IS APPOINTED "FizzBuzz"
    OR, IF NOT, by_three
      output IS APPOINTED "Fizz"
    OR, IF NOT, by_five
      output IS APPOINTED "Buzz"
    OTHERWISE,
      output IS APPOINTED AS IT WERE idx AS A YARN
  SO MUCH FOR THAT.

  BEHOLD output

  idx IS APPOINTED SUM OF idx AND 1

THE TERM EXPIRES.

BEHOLD "----------------------------------------------------------"
BEHOLD "The list is complete. I am satisfied."

FINALE.
